# After copying a task and deleting everything, motions, structure and metadata keys do nothing on the empty page, paste brings the task back, and o below the pasted note starts a block beside it.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
END
keys j y <C-a> dd
hide Work
keys j k x . > <Tab> <S-Tab> <A-j> <A-k> D gG * } cc h l ' = - + _
hide Work
keys p
see ▌ - Report
see     Draft due Friday
keys G o
type Fresh
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Report
	Draft due Friday
	Fresh
END
